</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002CVW016X_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I4P00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze frame data. Freeze frame data records part of the engine operating condition when a malfunction occurs, and this information is useful for troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002CVW016X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW016X_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00002VS00001">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness or Connector (Engine Control Computer - Air Fuel Ratio Sensor)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="2">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For wire harness inspection procedures and precautions, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D705AX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the engine control computer and the air fuel ratio sensor connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the engine control computer and the air fuel ratio sensor vehicle side connector. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="X39400000QV016D"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance (Check for Open)</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.21in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>Engine control computer vehicle side connector - Air fuel ratio sensor vehicle side connector</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A109(HA1A) - 1(HA1A)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A112(A1A+) - 3(A1A+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A113(A1A-) - 4(A1A-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Resistance (Check for Short)</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.21in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>Engine control computer vehicle side connector and air fuel ratio sensor vehicle side connector - Other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A109 (HA1A) and 1 (HA1A) - other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A112 (A1A+) and 3 (A1A+) - Other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A113 (A1A-) and 4 (A1A-) - Other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002CVW016X_04_0004" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002CVW016X_04_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW016X_04_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___00008ID00001">
<testtitle>Replace Air Fuel Ratio Sensor</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the air fuel ratio sensor replacement procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020W300AX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002CVW016X_04_0009" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW016X_04_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___00002VU00001">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002CVW016X_04_0005" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW016X_04_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00002VT00001">
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>After warming up the engine, drive in city traffic for 10 minutes or more.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.89in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No DTC is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTCs P2237/21, P2238/21, P2239/21, P2252/21 and P2253/21 are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The DTC judgment can be confirmed using the [Diagnosis Judgment Result Check] function of SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002CVW016X_04_0008" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000002CVW016X_04_0006" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW016X_04_0006">
<testtitle>Replace Engine Control Computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020V0005X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW016X_04_0007">
<testtitle>Repair or replace wire harness or connector (engine control computer - air fuel ratio sensor)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW016X_04_0008">
<testtitle>Return to Normal</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
